templateBody:
Hello ECS Global Engagement Support (ECS GES),
Please initiate the invoicing process at O2I Teams as per details below.
Customer: {{customerName}}
Customer Account ID: {{customerAccountId}}
Service Code: {{serviceCode}}
Service Type: {{serviceType}}
SID: {{sid}}
- Total amount with currency: {{price}} {{currency}}
  ({{priceInWords}})
- Sales order no. / Provider contract no.: {{salesOrderNumber}}
- SAP4Me Ticket ID: {{sap4MeTicketId}}
- SPC Ticket ID: {{spcTicketId}}
- BTP Ticket ID: {{btpTicketId}}
- AMS Ticket ID: {{amsTicketId}}
- ServiceNow Ticket ID: {{serviceNowTicketId}}
- PO no. (if provided): {{poNumber}}
- Activity performed: {{activityPerformed}}
- Approval date: {{approvalDate}}
- Delivery date: {{deliveryDate}}
JIRA queue: ECSBO
Best regards,
CDM Team
